# weightless: the saved game the weightwrap session (DOS's golden) starts from. A new character,
# as the newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a candle (0x092) into the pack, a shortsword
# (0x004) at the player's feet, and the carried weight set to 0, as a saved game edited
# elsewhere can hold it while the pack holds the candle. Saved in slot 1, described "weightless"
14000 key esc
16500 key esc
20000 key enter        # Create Character
24000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
26000 key enter        # the difficulty
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key enter
36000 key enter
38000 key enter
40000 key a            # the name
40200 key v
40400 key a
40600 key t
40800 key a
41000 key r
42000 key enter
44000 key enter        # Yes
52000 cheat give 0x092
52100 cheat give 0x004 drop
52200 cheat set weight 0
55000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot 1, "weightless"
55100 key s
55300 up ctrl
57000 key enter
58500 key w
58700 key e
58900 key i
59100 key g
59300 key h
59500 key t
59700 key l
59900 key e
60100 key s
60300 key s
61500 key enter
